# INVWINUD.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the Admin menu
# below level 3.  At level 1 its entries are grayed and choosing Users
# gives no command; after File > Log out, at level 2, Sessions gives
# none either.  The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINUD.SNP is its
# snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER ALT-A
S ADMIN1
K U
S NOUSERS
K ESC ESC ALT-F L STAB
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER ALT-A S
S NOSESS
K ESC ESC ALT-F X
